<title>GERMANY: TABLE-BASF Q2 PRETAX UP AT 1.295 BLN DMK.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BASF Q2 PRETAX UP AT 1.295 BLN DMK.</headline>
<dateline>LUDWIGSHAFEN, Germany 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     1,295   vs 1,203</p>
<p>    Income from operations		   1,337   vs 1,273</p>
<p>    Group net sales			    14,358  vs 12,435</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>     Germany				     3,615   vs 3,162</p>
<p>     Outside Germany			   10,743  vs 9,273</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemical group is BASF AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
